  messageList:
  - Hi !
  - 'Welcome to this game.

    It is a pleasure talking with you.'
  - I hope you will enjoy this demonstration
  - I suggest you take a look around
  - Did you take the key ?
  - Did you take the gem ?
  - You have to reach the destination through the maze.
  - Ted will help you if you are lost.
  - Now go explore this scene.
  - Stop talking to me and go find the destination
